              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mugabane w’Abisirayeli, muze mutoranye kimwe ku bintu mirongo itanu, baba abantu, amasho, indogoba, intama, impene canke ibindi bitungwa vyose. Muze mubihe Abalewi, bashinzwe gutunganya ihema ry’",
          "type": "text",
